{"unit_id":"Yidien__dsh-session-sight#card-zh","repo":"Yidien/dsh-session-sight","commit":"d5d7119f51a9de3fabab18ac5b412453accd0b67","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-sight 是面向 DSH Web 侧栏和命令通道的会话管理插件，在侧栏底部提供活跃会话与归档会话入口，并注册斜杠命令。用户可以按会话 ID 或标题查找记录，预览最近的对话内容，将会话归档后再取消归档，或将其移入系统回收站；插件还提供临时回收站的查看、恢复和清理命令。预览支持展示最近消息，命令行也能列出归档记录、处理孤儿条目。适合需要整理会话、确认内容后再删除，或找回已归档记录的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号；可选通过 DSH_HOME 指定数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:821-850","lib/index.js:948-1002","lib/client.js:176-186"]}
{"unit_id":"Yidien__dsh-session-sight#card-en","repo":"Yidien/dsh-session-sight","commit":"d5d7119f51a9de3fabab18ac5b412453accd0b67","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-sight manages DSH sessions through Web sidebar entries and slash commands. Find sessions by ID or title, preview recent messages, archive and restore records, or move them to the system recycle bin. It also lists and restores temporary trash. No API key is needed; DSH_HOME is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:821-850","lib/index.js:948-1002","lib/client.js:176-186"]}
